      "text": "Neither discounted cash flow template used on this site applies to TATAPOWER: Template A needs free cash flow to the firm to be positive in at least three of the last four years, and it was −₹2,583 crore in FY24, −₹3,368 crore in FY25 and −₹10,462 crore in FY26; Template B, for companies reinvesting at a return above their cost of capital, needs the median return on invested capital of the last three years to beat that cost, and it was 8.0% against 8.74%, so no model value is shown.",
